      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Cookie-Free LinkedIn Profile & Work Email Enrichment to Google Sheets\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nEnrich LinkedIn profile URLs or executive search queries with verified work emails and titles without LinkedIn cookies, then append directly to Google Sheets / Clay.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/linkedin-profile-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify LinkedIn Profile & Email Scraper No Cookies** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "bb9893bf-5967-444a-af9b-99b5b48ad80a",
